  "implemented": [
    "Typed TemplateId, Spawn/Despawn and explicit frozen GetTemplate/TryGetTemplate component values through appended native callbacks.",
    "Reserve generated IDs during Tick; initialize known pending component layouts with full replacements and validate mutually referencing births/global state in the final candidate. Reads retain committed membership.",
    "Publish gameplay and host-scheduled structure once per affected tick, gameplay IDs before host IDs; host results contain only host births. Newly born kinematic props can move in the creation tick.",
    "Cancel pending births without creating native owners, discard their component and movement initializers, retain consumed IDs on success and record cancel-only allocation history in v3 snapshots.",
    "Restore membership, native/component/global/physics state, allocation cursors and save requests after later-tick failure. Invalid synchronous spawn callbacks preserve reservation state when caught.",
    "Enforce combined host/gameplay 4096 structural-command budget including canceled calls, and combined pending recipe/staged component payload limit of 2 MiB.",
    "Validate frozen assets at runtime construction; spawn overrides reuse transform validation without rescanning immutable mesh geometry.",
    "Coordinate discovery, runtime metadata, NativeAOT artifact publisher/loader and game bundle gates on services ABI6; retain compatibility of legacy bundles without gameplay."
  ],
